{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop</i> is an atmospheric, surreal, first-person puzzle game where you use your camera to capture the essence of a life lived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this end, you have been delivered to The Charity Shop, the place where people donate unwanted belongings\u2014each carrying an imprint of the time they once shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/1b62e8a96dbcfc45261efbf0f78898a4.avif?t=1769689853\" width=560 height=560 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch at permanence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet against the rising tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your head is under, it will be over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/20e9aafd76604d59a9d1849f8c1d6d53.avif?t=1769689853\" width=560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything here is in a state of flux\u2014the negative space between owners. From one owner to the next, we're here to help pass the baton.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;People always have things to donate\u2014whether the owners have outlived their belongings, or their belongings have outlived them, we're always getting different things.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your digital camera to take photographs capturing the essence of a life lived, through objects once owned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and interpret your own meaning behind these objects by solving their puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve these memories forever. Someone needs to remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop has around 60 to 90 minutes of gameplay.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548550?t=1769689853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548550?t=1769689853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/74d6a98885a811ffd4d879864eee460be7d416c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769689853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/74d6a98885a811ffd4d879864eee460be7d416c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769689853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains a depiction of a scene involving a fatal car accident. There are many references to death in general in this game."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop</i> is an atmospheric, surreal, first-person puzzle game where you use your camera to capture the essence of a life lived. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this end, you have been delivered to The Charity Shop, the place where people donate unwanted belongings\u2014each carrying an imprint of the time they once shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/1b62e8a96dbcfc45261efbf0f78898a4.avif?t=1769689853\" width=560 height=560 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutch at permanence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your feet against the rising tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your head is under, it will be over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/extras/20e9aafd76604d59a9d1849f8c1d6d53.avif?t=1769689853\" width=560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything here is in a state of flux\u2014the negative space between owners. From one owner to the next, we're here to help pass the baton.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;People always have things to donate\u2014whether the owners have outlived their belongings, or their belongings have outlived them, we're always getting different things.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your digital camera to take photographs capturing the essence of a life lived, through objects once owned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover and interpret your own meaning behind these objects by solving their puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preserve these memories forever. Someone needs to remember...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Charity Shop has around 60 to 90 minutes of gameplay.</i></p>","developers":["Figglewatts"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548550/7e999c2f69511fb491ac0c671a4bd769b9addfef/header.jpg?t=1769689853","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core Intel or AMD processor, 2GHz or faster<br></li><li><stro